Package: fieldlink-pi-kiosk
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Field Link Missions <support@fieldlinkmissions.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://fieldlinkmissions.com
Depends: cage, adduser, fonts-liberation, fonts-noto-color-emoji, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libnotify4, libnss3, libxss1, libxtst6, libatspi2.0-0t64 | libatspi2.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64 | libatk-bridge2.0-0, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libcups2t64 | libcups2, libuuid1, libgbm1, libdrm2, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxfixes3, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2, libdbus-1-3, libexpat1
Recommends: libgl1-mesa-dri
Description: Field Link Missions kiosk display (Raspberry Pi)
 Full-screen shell around the FieldLink kiosk web page, started at boot by
 the fieldlink-kiosk systemd unit under the cage Wayland compositor. Pairs
 with FieldLink Admin by an on-screen code and checks its key every 30 s.
